  "description": "Clinical-text safe patterns for Philter.NET. A sidecar configuration that\n      prepends to the upstream philter_delta pipeline, rescuing legitimate clinical\n      text (BP readings, lab values, dose patterns, drug names, medical abbreviations,\n      pain scales, etc.) from over-redaction. Developed against synthetic clinical\n      encounter notes inside a private healthcare-coding product (SmartCodingAI);\n      released here so adopters don't have to rediscover the same edge cases.",
